{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36641","headline":"京口见李侍郎 · 罗隐","name":"京口见李侍郎","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"傞傞江柳欲矜春，铁瓮城边见故人。\n屈指不堪言甲子，披风常记是庚申。\n别来且喜身俱健，乱後休悲业尽贫。\n还有杖头沽酒物，待寻山寺话逡巡。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"罗隐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_36641.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36641","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}